<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets up 23 pct Jan-Nov - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets up 23 pct Jan-Nov - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 23.16 percent in the first 11 months of the year, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, at end of period unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    Dec 95   Sep 96   Oct 96   Nov 96   Dec95-Nov96</p>
<p>									   %</p>
<p>Total Assets    29.055   33.353   34.775   35.784	23.16</p>
<p>Month change (%)	    1.40     4.26     2.90</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    23,884   27,663   29,062   29.870	25.06</p>
<p>Month change (%)	    1.17     5.06     2.78</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    10,695   12,376   12,613   13,014	21.69</p>
<p>Month change (%)	    1.44     1.91     3.18</p>
<p>Total capital    1,146    1,385    1,401    1,539	34.27</p>
<p> Month change (%)	  (0.26)    1.17     9.83</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
